---
description: "Cursor overlay for Nuxt/Vue files. Canonical rules live in AGENTS.md."
globs:
  - "pages/**/*.vue"
  - "components/**/*.vue"
  - "composables/**/*.ts"
  - "server/**/*.ts"
  - "stores/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md`.

When editing matching files:

- Use `<script setup lang="ts">`.
- Keep API logic in `server/api/`, not in components.
- Prefer composables for shared client logic.
- Do not put secrets in client-visible code.
- Show the full file path before proposing code.
